    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Appetite better; weight 64.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No gum or mouth symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No tremor, numbness, or headache</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mood lifting but still low most mornings; no suicidal thoughts, elevated mood, or agitation</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
